    {
      "id": "claim_1881af4a3f0b4203b8cc2657fa6e1d4c",
      "statement": "Replication is in-process: one shared object_store client per node plus a managed celld_ltx::Db per resident cell that captures committed WAL and uploads on demand, with no external replicator and no directory-watch lag — a cell registers the instant it activates so the output gate has no cold-start window.",
