    {
      "id": "claim_232da21a7b6b48acae72f28e366b043c",
      "statement": "The output gate defaults on: CELLD_OUTPUT_GATE=1 proves each write durable before its response is acknowledged (0 removes the replication wait and accepts possible loss), and the alarm contract extends it — an event setting an alarm before its response boundary gets no success until a durable wake entry covers the alarm.",
      "evidence": [
        {
