    {
      "id": "claim_0c0574502f0146cb9a5ad1a813a32639",
      "statement": "Measured durability costs, with conditions: a lab fleet measured about 600 ms for a bucket proof and about 25 ms for a fleet proof; the bucket upload races every fleet proof so a slow follower cannot make a write slower than a bucket proof; concurrent writes to one cell join one shared upload.",
