    {
      "id": "claim_c52ae609edf942ecade68bb7eb7d321e",
      "statement": "Node-log log-append tuning: CELLD_LOG_HEDGE_MS sends a second copy of a slow append (default adaptive — 4× the slowest recent append, ≥250 ms, below the eviction backstop; 0 disables), safe because appends are idempotent per sequence; the code chooses between Fixed and Adaptive hedge arming; CELLD_LOG_CAPTURE_WORKERS (default 8) bounds capture workers and CELLD_LOG_PIPELINE (default 4) bounds in-flight fleet log rounds.",
