    {
      "id": "claim_11e503871b61494482b7064addc7ee6e",
      "statement": "Local durability stacks have a unique in-process owner, node_log::DurabilityOwner — it controls the coupled LTX/node-log registration and retains background-task handles until shutdown joins them; removal of the old public setters (set_shipper, set_bundle_sink) and spawns (spawn_maintenance, spawn_fragment_gc) closed an ownership cycle and a detached-task hole.",
