    {
      "id": "claim_9c798460cef44e888fcd79ec2cab7879",
      "statement": "Compaction stacks levels for restore cost: additive L1 objects on by default (CELLD_LTX_COMPACTION) so a takeover reads tens of objects instead of thousands,paced by CELLD_LTX_COMPACTION_MIN_TXIDS=256 and bounded by CELLD_LTX_COMPACTIONS=2; a final handoff publishes an L9 full snapshot so the successor does not replay the whole history, and the proven additive L0 chain remains the fallback artifact.",
